## 📚 Course APIs

### **POST /courses**
- **Purpose:** Create a new course (instructor/admin only)  
- **Headers:** `Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>`  
- **Request:**
```json
{
  "title": "Intro to Sign Language",
  "description": "Beginner course covering basics",
  "level": "beginner"
}
```
- **Response:**
```json
{
  "course_id": "c101",
  "message": "Course created successfully"
}
```

---

### **GET /courses**
- **Purpose:** Retrieve all courses  
- **Response:**
```json
[
  {
    "course_id": "c101",
    "title": "Intro to Sign Language",
    "level": "beginner"
  },
  {
    "course_id": "c102",
    "title": "Advanced Sign Language",
    "level": "advanced"
  }
]
```

---

### **GET /courses/{course_id}**
- **Purpose:** Retrieve course details by ID  
- **Response:**
```json
{
  "course_id": "c101",
  "title": "Intro to Sign Language",
  "description": "Beginner course covering basics",
  "level": "beginner",
  "lessons": [
    {"lesson_id": "l1", "title": "Alphabet"},
    {"lesson_id": "l2", "title": "Basic Greetings"}
  ]
}
```

---

### **PUT /courses/{course_id}**
- **Purpose:** Update course details (instructor/admin only)  
- **Headers:** `Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>`  
- **Request:**
```json
{
  "title": "Intro to Sign Language - Updated",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "level": "intermediate"
}
```
- **Response:**
```json
{
  "message": "Course updated successfully"
}
```

---

### **DELETE /courses/{course_id}**
- **Purpose:** Delete a course (admin only)  
- **Headers:** `Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>`  
- **Response:**
```json
{
  "message": "Course deleted successfully"
}
